WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.000
ONE Open. Every open house, from sign-in to signed.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
It lives inside ONE Brain: plan, prepare, host, follow up.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.000
Open it and see what needs you, and what's next.

00:14.500 --> 00:19.200
Every prep task on its own clock. Tick them off.

00:19.700 --> 00:24.200
Invite the whole street first, and see who wants a home value.

00:24.700 --> 00:29.800
At the door, every visitor signs in. Then, next guest.

00:30.300 --> 00:34.800
Watch your open house in real time, with safety check-in on.

00:35.300 --> 00:39.600
Rate every visitor. Five stars means call first.

00:40.100 --> 00:45.200
The follow-up is already planned, day one to week four.

00:45.700 --> 00:50.000
Send your seller the report in one tap.

00:50.500 --> 00:55.000
Open houses to conversations to clients. Week after week.

00:55.500 --> 01:00.000
Coming soon: visitors flow into ONE MOVE, tagged. Never into your VIP-50.

01:00.500 --> 01:05.200
ONE Open. From sign-in to signed. Part of ONE.
